  "text": "```verilog\nmodule apbslave #(\n\t\tparameter\tC_APB_ADDR_WIDTH = 12,\n\t\tparameter\tC_APB_DATA_WIDTH = 32,\n\t\tlocalparam\tAW = C_APB_ADDR_WIDTH,\n\t\tlocalparam\tDW = C_APB_DATA_WIDTH,\n\t\tlocalparam\tAPBLSB = $clog2(C_APB_DATA_WIDTH)-3\n\t) (\n\t\tinput\twire\t\t\tPCLK, PRESETn,\n\t\tinput\twire\t\t\tPSEL,\n\t\tinput\twire\t\t\tPENABLE,\n\t\toutput\treg\t\t\tPREADY,\n\t\tinput\twire\t[AW-1:0]\tPADDR,\n\t\tinput\twire\t\t\tPWRITE,\n\t\tinput\twire\t[DW-1:0]\tPWDATA,\n\t\tinput\twire\t[DW/8-1:0]\tPWSTRB,\n\t\tinput\twire\t[2:0]\t\tPPROT,\n\t\toutput\treg\t[DW-1:0]\tPRDATA,\n\t\toutput\twire\t\t\tPSLVERR\n\t);\n\n\t// Internal state\n\treg [DW-1:0] mem [0:2**AW-1];\n\treg [DW-1:0] rdata_reg;\n\treg           rdata_valid;\n\n\t// APB state machine\n\treg [1:0] state;\n\tlocalparam S_IDLE = 2'd0;\n\tlocalparam S_SETUP = 2'd1;\n\tlocalparam S_ACCESS = 2'd2;\n\n\t// PSLVERR is always low for in-range accesses\n\tassign PSLVERR = 1'b0;\n\n\t// PREADY is high when in IDLE or when access phase completes\n\t// In APB, PREADY can be asserted during setup or access phase\n\t// For a simple slave, we assert PREADY during setup phase to indicate ready\n\t// and complete the transfer in access phase\n\t// Standard APB: PREADY high during setup means slave is ready, transfer completes in access\n\t// PREADY high during access means transfer is complete\n\n\t// We'll use a simple approach:\n\t// - In IDLE: PREADY = 1\n\t// - In SETUP: PREADY = 1 (slave is ready)\n\t// - In ACCESS: PREADY = 1 (transfer completes)\n\n\talways @(posedge PCLK or negedge PRESETn) begin\n\t\tif (!PRESETn) begin\n\t\t\tstate <= S_IDLE;\n\t\t\tPREADY <= 1'b1;\n\t\t\trdata_reg <= {DW{1'b0}};\n\t\t\trdata_valid <= 1'b0;\n\t\tend else begin\n\t\t\tcase (state)\n\t\t\t\tS_IDLE: begin\n\t\t\t\t\tPREADY <= 1'b1;\n\t\t\t\t\tif (PSEL) begin\n\t\t\t\t\t\tstate <= S_SETUP;\n\t\t\t\t\tend\n\t\t\t\tend\n\t\t\t\tS_SETUP: begin\n\t\t\t\t\tPREADY <= 1'b1;\n\t\t\t\t\tif (PENABLE) begin\n\t\t\t\t\t\tstate <= S_ACCESS;\n\t\t\t\t\t\tif (PWRITE) begin\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t// Perform write\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tfor (integer i = 0; i < DW/8; i = i + 1) begin\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tif (PWSTRB[i]) begin\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tmem[PADDR[AW-1:APBLSB]][i*8 +: 8] <= PWDATA[i*8 +: 8];\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tend\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tend\n\t\t\t\t\t\tend else begin\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t// Perform read\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\trdata_reg <= mem[PADDR[AW-1:APBLSB]];\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\trdata_valid <= 1'b1;\n\t\t\t\t\t\tend\n\t\t\t\t\tend\n\t\t\t\tend\n\t\t\t\tS_ACCESS: begin\n\t\t\t\t\tPREADY <= 1'b1;\n\t\t\t\t\tstate <= S_IDLE;\n\t\t\t\tend\n\t\t\t\tdefault: begin\n\t\t\t\t\tstate <= S_IDLE;\n\t\t\t\t\tPREADY <= 1'b1;\n\t\t\t\tend\n\t\t\tendcase\n\t\tend\n\tend\n\n\t// Output data\n\talways @(posedge PCLK or negedge PRESETn) begin\n\t\tif (!PRESETn) begin\n\t\t\tPRDATA <= {DW{1'b0}};\n\t\tend else begin\n\t\t\tif (rdata_valid) begin\n\t\t\t\tPRDATA <= rdata_reg;\n\t\t\t\trdata_valid <= 1'b0;\n\t\t\tend\n\t\tend\n\tend\n\nendmodule\n```<|im_end|>",
